            <ArticleTitle>Synthesis of Two Well-Defined Quadruple-Stranded Copolymers having Two Kinds of Backbones by Postpolymerization of a Helical Template Polymer.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/marc.201700556</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A brand new, soluble quadruple-stranded copolymer is synthesized by using a self-template polymer from a new monomer. In addition, another very unique quadruple-stranded copolymer having a π-π stacking supramolecular polymer main chain is synthesized by selective photocyclic aromatization of the quadruple-stranded copolymer. The two quadruple-stranded copolymers gave self-standing membranes.</AbstractText>
